---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import studentShowcaseConcept from '../assets/student-showcase-concept.png';
import '../styles/students-showcase.css';

---
<section class="ah-students ah-students-showcase ah-section" id="students" aria-labelledby="students-heading">
  <div class="ah-section-heading">
    <div><span class="ah-kicker">创作在此相遇</span><h2 id="students-heading" tabindex="-1">游戏与作品</h2></div>
    <p>学生作品与独立游戏，在现场分享创作与交流。</p>
  </div>
  <figure class="ah-showcase-media" data-public-showcases-concept>
    <Image src={studentShowcaseConcept} alt="学生嘉年华创作概念视觉" width={1600} height={900} fit="cover" format="webp" quality={85} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    <figcaption>
      <h3>让想法，在现场相遇。</h3>
      <p>创作概念视觉 · 游戏与作品陆续公布</p>
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
  <div class="ah-showcase-filters" data-public-works-controls hidden>
    <label for="public-works-filter">作品分类<select id="public-works-filter" data-public-works-filter><option value="all">全部作品</option><option value="student">学生作品</option><option value="indie">独立游戏</option></select></label>
    <div class="ah-work-navigation" aria-label="浏览作品"><button type="button" data-public-work-prev aria-label="上一件作品" disabled>←</button><p data-public-works-count role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button type="button" data-public-work-next aria-label="下一件作品" disabled>→</button></div>
  </div>
  <p class="ah-showcase-filter-empty" data-public-works-filter-empty role="status" hidden>这个分类的作品尚未公布。</p>
  <ul class="ah-showcase-grid" data-public-showcases aria-label="已公布的游戏与作品" hidden></ul>
  <div class="ah-showcase-empty" data-public-showcases-empty hidden>
    <span class="ah-kicker">作品现场</span>
    <h3>创作，陆续登场。</h3>
    <p>游戏与作品陆续公布。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="ah-student-actions">
    <a href="#agenda" class="ah-text-action">查看全天日程 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <small>作品展示、分享时段与正式参会名额分别确认。</small>
  </div>
  <dialog class="ah-work-lightbox" data-work-lightbox aria-labelledby="work-lightbox-title">
    <div class="ah-work-lightbox-bar"><h3 id="work-lightbox-title" data-work-lightbox-title>作品图</h3><button type="button" data-work-lightbox-close aria-label="关闭作品大图">关闭 ×</button></div>
    <img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" crossorigin="anonymous" />
  </dialog>
  <noscript><p>游戏与作品陆续公布；启用 JavaScript 可读取最新作品与分类。</p></noscript>
</section>
